<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-May 1997 GDP rises 5.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-May 1997 GDP rises 5.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's gross domestic product in the first five months of 1997 rose 5.2 percent year-on-year compared to a 1.7 percent rise in the first five months of 1996, the National Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ GDP		    Jan-May 97  Jan-Apr 97  Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	+5.2	  +0.7	  +1.7</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
